---
import ProseLayout from "../layouts/ProseLayout.astro";
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Support | Threadlines"
  heading="Support"
  description="Where to get help with Threadlines, report a bug or report a security problem."
  canonicalPath="/support"
>
  <p>Threadlines is built by one person, so a good report gets the fastest answer.</p>

  <h2>Bugs and questions</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="https://github.com/Threadlines/threadlines/issues">Open an issue on GitHub</a>. Say what you did,
    what happened, and your Threadlines version, which is in Settings. Leave out anything private: issues are
    public.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    For anything you'd rather not post in public, write to
    <a href="mailto:support@threadlines.dev">support@threadlines.dev</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Security problems</h2>
  <p>
    Please report these privately, through a
    <a href="https://github.com/Threadlines/threadlines/security/advisories/new">GitHub security advisory</a>, not
    a public issue.
  </p>

  <h2>Connecting an assistant</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="/docs/assistants">The assistants guide</a> covers connecting Grok Bot, a ChatGPT dot, Claude or Muse,
    and what to do when one won't connect.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
